              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Toni Mo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used to purchase a cranberry almond pasta kit through a kid's fundraiser and LOVED it. Found this recipe through google search. It's great! I'll make a smaller portion of the dressing mix next time, but otherwise I loved it! I skip the celery.. simply because I don't like celery.",
            "datePublished": "2015-04-07T11:40:14.840Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tara"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I gave this 3 stars based on the recipe, as written. I've since modified the recipe to suite my family. I added 2 red delicious apples (diced and dipped in lemon juice), cashews instead of almonds, red onion, Craisens instead of cranberries (less tart), and reduced the amount of cider vinegar and sugar. This recipe is a good jumping off point - modify to your liking.",
            "datePublished": "2013-07-30T15:41:45.790Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
