            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amy McLaughlin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I would do 1/2 cup mayo, 1/8 cup vinegar and 1/8 cup sugar. I also added about 1/2 cup of fresh chopped basil which gave it a wonderful basil flavour.",
            "datePublished": "2013-07-06T08:23:31.193Z"
